# Read-mode combo — exhaustive function enumeration with rich Chinese notes
#
# Covers the evidence-richness contract for closed-set enumerations:
# the answer must keep the function list complete while preserving useful
# per-function rationale, especially Eval/EvalAll error semantics. This
# guards against deterministic row compilation flattening rich summaries into
# dry "symbol defined at line X" prose.
ID="read_combo_criterion_rich_functions"
NAME="read combo — criterion public functions with rich notes"
QUESTION="internal/analysis/criterion 只列公开函数，不列类型、变量或 Kind 常量；每个函数都要给出文件:行和一句中文职责说明，尤其说明 Eval/EvalAll 与 UnknownKind/failed 结果的关系。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="Eval EvalAll IsRegistered RegisteredKinds SetExternalArtifactFloor UnknownKind"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(Eval.*UnknownKind|UnknownKind.*Eval)
(EvalAll.*failed|failed.*EvalAll|EvalAll.*失败|失败.*EvalAll)
(IsRegistered|RegisteredKinds)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="KindSymbolPresent defaultExternalArtifactFloor"

